    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jump into Mine Spiders, a relentless nightmare buried beneath the desert.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mission was simple: locate the missing team and restore contact. But the deeper you go, the clearer it becomes that this place is far from abandoned. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br> Infested with towering, flesh-eating spiders that move faster than your light can catch, crawling across ceilings, walls, and out of every shadow. With each step forward, the mine closes in shrinking corridors, flickering flares, and the echo of something moving just around the corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688140/extras/8af1a35ec450862703149cb50ab16150.poster.avif?t=1750542739\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688140/extras/8af1a35ec450862703149cb50ab16150.webm?t=1750542739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688140/extras/8af1a35ec450862703149cb50ab16150.mp4?t=1750542739\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend deeper into the mine exploring and shooting your way through 8 intense levels, each taking you deeper into the mine's twisted depths. From collapsing tunnels to web-covered chambers, every level ramps up the chaos with more enemies, tighter spaces, and escalating horror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crafted by solo-dev nokturnal artist from Detroit, Michigan. Mine Spiders pushes the limits of fast-paced high intensity horror combat, 360-degree threat awareness, and bodycam-style photorealism\u2014delivering a uniquely raw high contrast experience for the genre.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t survival. This is extermination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688140/extras/9eac123845e25b2d2db9f30bc64bca0e.poster.avif?t=1750542739\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688140/extras/9eac123845e25b2d2db9f30bc64bca0e.webm?t=1750542739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688140/extras/9eac123845e25b2d2db9f30bc64bca0e.mp4?t=1750542739\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Terrifying Enemies:</u></strong> Battle massive, flesh-eating spiders that swarm from walls, ceilings, and tunnels. They're fast, aggressive, and everywhere.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Tactical FPS Combat:</u></strong> Fight your way through claustrophobic tunnels with brutal gunplay, dynamic lighting, and high-impact visuals that don\u2019t hold back.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Bodycam Horror Experience:</u></strong> Feel the chaos through a raw, unfiltered bodycam perspective that puts you right in the middle of the nightmare.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>High-Intensity Gunplay:</u></strong> Shoot, jump, and blast your way through waves of enemies in tight underground spaces with bodycam-style first-person combat.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Immersive Environments:</u></strong> Explore a dark, abandoned mine brought to life with gritty visuals, creepy atmosphere, and web-covered tunnels.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Weapon Variety:</u></strong> Locate new weapons as you progress, each with its own firepower to help you wipe out the spider horde. Relentless Action: No puzzles just pure forward momentum as you fight your way deeper and try to survive what\u2019s below.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688140/extras/e5d16a9f63c943406fc1000a35553e54.poster.avif?t=1750542739\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688140/extras/e5d16a9f63c943406fc1000a35553e54.webm?t=1750542739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688140/extras/e5d16a9f63c943406fc1000a35553e54.mp4?t=1750542739\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed with heavy firepower and no backup, you\u2019ll blast through swarms of aggressive enemies in an unbroken descent through darkness.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just you, your gun, and the horrors waiting below.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688140/extras/6c7b59f8d5b45eeceb0eb1e96dc1b377.poster.avif?t=1750542739\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688140/extras/6c7b59f8d5b45eeceb0eb1e96dc1b377.webm?t=1750542739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688140/extras/6c7b59f8d5b45eeceb0eb1e96dc1b377.mp4?t=1750542739\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Originally developed as a brutal vision of first-person terror, Mine Spiders combines the raw intensity of tactical combat with an immersive bodycam horror perspective, delivering a new kind of nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jump into Mine Spiders, a relentless nightmare buried beneath the desert.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mission was simple: locate the missing team and restore contact. But the deeper you go, the clearer it becomes that this place is far from abandoned. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br> Infested with towering, flesh-eating spiders that move faster than your light can catch, crawling across ceilings, walls, and out of every shadow. With each step forward, the mine closes in shrinking corridors, flickering flares, and the echo of something moving just around the corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688140/extras/8af1a35ec450862703149cb50ab16150.poster.avif?t=1750542739\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688140/extras/8af1a35ec450862703149cb50ab16150.webm?t=1750542739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688140/extras/8af1a35ec450862703149cb50ab16150.mp4?t=1750542739\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend deeper into the mine exploring and shooting your way through 8 intense levels, each taking you deeper into the mine's twisted depths. From collapsing tunnels to web-covered chambers, every level ramps up the chaos with more enemies, tighter spaces, and escalating horror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crafted by solo-dev nokturnal artist from Detroit, Michigan. Mine Spiders pushes the limits of fast-paced high intensity horror combat, 360-degree threat awareness, and bodycam-style photorealism\u2014delivering a uniquely raw high contrast experience for the genre.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Th